84150/extras/a281d551c4418655db652e684e1094a8.webm?t=1748274372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884150/extras/a281d551c4418655db652e684e1094a8.mp4?t=1748274372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prey System</h2> Explore in any direction you like. But beware: the longer a dive team spends down there, the greater the threats they will attract.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Missions</h2> Take on dangerous missions during your dives to earn greater rewards and progress the plot.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the Roster</h2> The Roster are a psionically connected force, waiting for you to unleash them. Build a base strategy from a variety of entries, and grow it as you descend into the depths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884150/extras/5fbdda6c17ce0d04b803cc305e38da13.poster.avif?t=1748274372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884150/extras/5fbdda6c17ce0d04b803cc305e38da13.webm?t=1748274372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884150/extras/5fbdda6c17ce0d04b803cc305e38da13.mp4?t=1748274372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your dive lead</h2> Dive leads are unique and have a variety of skills that shape each descent into the depths.<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new options</h2> As your operator rank grows and you complete unique challenges, more dive leads and roster entries will become available for you to unleash upon your enemies.</li></ul>",
